SUBENT        C3136004   20260717   20261014   20261014       C259
BIB                  5         10
REACTION   (10-NE-20(A,EL)10-NE-20,,DA)
ANALYSIS   To extract total reaction cross sections, the
           differential center-of-mass cross-section data for
           the 20Ne(alpha,p0)23Na and 20Ne(alpha,p1)23Na
           reactions were fit using a weighted sum of Legendre
           polynomials. From the fits, the total cross sections
           could then be calculated as sigma = 4*pi*a0.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) No details on sources of uncertainties.
CORRECTION Normalized spectrum.
STATUS     (CURVE,,C.Boomershine+,J,PR/C,113,065804,2026) Fig. - 4
